    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, I'll look into the container isolation. The thing is, the dependency errors are the most confusing part because everything seems fine in the local dev environment. It's almost like something is changing under the hood in the build agent during the run. Are there any specific logs or monitoring tools you'd recommend to track what's actually happening with the filesystem or network state during those exact moments of failure?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
